0..76 Comment "// What an inductive-recursive block refuses. The block is one admission, so"
77..153 Comment "// one refused member refuses every member with it: accessibility is checked"
154..231 Comment "// across the block, so a family named to the left of an arrow where no stage"
232..301 Comment "// reaches, in another family\'s field, refuses the block whole; and a"
302..379 Comment "// decode a code\'s field holds must stand below the code, so a field decoding"
380..458 Comment "// a code it was not built from, or a decoder arm decoding its own code again,"
459..538 Comment "// refuses the decoder by the stage order and its codes with it. A decode reads"
539..608 Comment "// a call only when the call returns a code. The block also refuses a"
609..683 Comment "// hierarchy of universes by level at its universe code. That code decodes"
684..724 Comment "// to the family itself, one level down."
725..789 Comment "// Shared with `../../model/universe/inductive-recursive.gandr`."
790..792 Comment "//"
793..847 Comment "// - owes: #3574 — a hierarchy of universes by level"
848..873 Comment "// - see: #517 — `Left`"
875..912 Comment "// The naturals and the two branches."
